[
  {
    "start": "00:00:04.301",
    "end": "00:00:09.440",
    "start_seconds": 4.301,
    "end_seconds": 9.44,
    "text": "The Earth is producing about a third more power from the sun"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:09.473",
    "end": "00:00:11.208",
    "start_seconds": 9.473,
    "end_seconds": 11.208,
    "text": "this spring than last."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:11.675",
    "end": "00:00:15.446",
    "start_seconds": 11.675,
    "end_seconds": 15.446,
    "text": "That solar power is suddenly so cheap and abundant"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:15.479",
    "end": "00:00:19.750",
    "start_seconds": 15.479,
    "end_seconds": 19.75,
    "text": "that Australians will soon get three hours of electricity"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:19.784",
    "end": "00:00:22.386",
    "start_seconds": 19.784,
    "end_seconds": 22.386,
    "text": "free every afternoon, free."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:22.420",
    "end": "00:00:26.190",
    "start_seconds": 22.42,
    "end_seconds": 26.19,
    "text": "After 400,000 years of working hard for energy,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:26.190",
    "end": "00:00:29.827",
    "start_seconds": 26.19,
    "end_seconds": 29.827,
    "text": "from gathering firewood to paying the power bill,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:29.860",
    "end": "00:00:34.999",
    "start_seconds": 29.86,
    "end_seconds": 34.999,
    "text": "some humans will suddenly have access to this commodity for nothing."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:35.499",
    "end": "00:00:39.403",
    "start_seconds": 35.499,
    "end_seconds": 39.403,
    "text": "California, fourth largest economy in the world,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:39.437",
    "end": "00:00:44.408",
    "start_seconds": 39.437,
    "end_seconds": 44.408,
    "text": "now produces most days more than 100 percent of its electricity"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:44.442",
    "end": "00:00:45.876",
    "start_seconds": 44.442,
    "end_seconds": 45.876,
    "text": "from renewable energy."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:45.910",
    "end": "00:00:48.546",
    "start_seconds": 45.91,
    "end_seconds": 48.546,
    "text": "At night, when the sun goes down,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:48.579",
    "end": "00:00:53.918",
    "start_seconds": 48.579,
    "end_seconds": 53.918,
    "text": "big new batteries on the grid turn dark into daylight."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:53.951",
    "end": "00:00:56.554",
    "start_seconds": 53.951,
    "end_seconds": 56.554,
    "text": "In Pakistan, peasant farmers"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:56.587",
    "end": "00:01:00.658",
    "start_seconds": 56.587,
    "end_seconds": 60.658,
    "text": "who used to pay through the nose for diesel power"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:00.691",
    "end": "00:01:02.960",
    "start_seconds": 60.691,
    "end_seconds": 62.96,
    "text": "to run their irrigation pumps"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:02.993",
    "end": "00:01:05.629",
    "start_seconds": 62.993,
    "end_seconds": 65.629,
    "text": "are using 30 percent less of the fuel"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:05.629",
    "end": "00:01:08.399",
    "start_seconds": 65.629,
    "end_seconds": 68.399,
    "text": "than they were two years ago,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:08.432",
    "end": "00:01:13.237",
    "start_seconds": 68.432,
    "end_seconds": 73.237,
    "text": "in large part because they've imported millions of cheap Chinese solar panels"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:13.237",
    "end": "00:01:17.608",
    "start_seconds": 73.237,
    "end_seconds": 77.608,
    "text": "and gone on YouTube to figure out how to connect them up."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:17.641",
    "end": "00:01:22.480",
    "start_seconds": 77.64099999999999,
    "end_seconds": 82.48,
    "text": "They often lack the money to build the steel scaffolding"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:22.513",
    "end": "00:01:24.782",
    "start_seconds": 82.513,
    "end_seconds": 84.782,
    "text": "we're used to seeing at solar farms."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:24.815",
    "end": "00:01:25.983",
    "start_seconds": 84.815,
    "end_seconds": 85.983,
    "text": "No matter."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:26.016",
    "end": "00:01:29.720",
    "start_seconds": 86.01599999999999,
    "end_seconds": 89.72,
    "text": "They just lay them on the ground and point them at the sun."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:30.087",
    "end": "00:01:36.927",
    "start_seconds": 90.087,
    "end_seconds": 96.92699999999999,
    "text": "In a world where many, many big things have taken a very dark turn this decade,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:36.961",
    "end": "00:01:40.898",
    "start_seconds": 96.961,
    "end_seconds": 100.898,
    "text": "this is the one big thing that is going right."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:40.931",
    "end": "00:01:44.602",
    "start_seconds": 100.931,
    "end_seconds": 104.602,
    "text": "We have quite suddenly the opportunity to build a clean,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:44.635",
    "end": "00:01:48.005",
    "start_seconds": 104.63499999999999,
    "end_seconds": 108.005,
    "text": "abundant future if we simply seize it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:48.038",
    "end": "00:01:52.276",
    "start_seconds": 108.038,
    "end_seconds": 112.27600000000001,
    "text": "But most of us don't recognize how huge this moment is."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:52.743",
    "end": "00:01:55.579",
    "start_seconds": 112.743,
    "end_seconds": 115.57900000000001,
    "text": "In part, that's because we've spent decades"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:55.579",
    "end": "00:01:58.482",
    "start_seconds": 115.57900000000001,
    "end_seconds": 118.482,
    "text": "calling this stuff “alternative energy,”"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:58.516",
    "end": "00:02:03.420",
    "start_seconds": 118.51599999999999,
    "end_seconds": 123.42,
    "text": "and it's blinded us to the fact that it's now the obvious, common-sense,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:03.454",
    "end": "00:02:06.524",
    "start_seconds": 123.454,
    "end_seconds": 126.524,
    "text": "straightforward way to power the future."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:07.358",
    "end": "00:02:12.163",
    "start_seconds": 127.358,
    "end_seconds": 132.163,
    "text": "Roughly 90 percent of new electric generation around the world last year"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:12.196",
    "end": "00:02:13.931",
    "start_seconds": 132.196,
    "end_seconds": 133.931,
    "text": "came from the sun and the wind."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:13.931",
    "end": "00:02:17.668",
    "start_seconds": 133.931,
    "end_seconds": 137.668,
    "text": "And that, in turn, is because earlier this decade,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:17.701",
    "end": "00:02:21.205",
    "start_seconds": 137.701,
    "end_seconds": 141.20499999999998,
    "text": "we crossed some invisible line where it became cheaper"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:21.205",
    "end": "00:02:23.440",
    "start_seconds": 141.20499999999998,
    "end_seconds": 143.44,
    "text": "to produce power from the sun"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:23.474",
    "end": "00:02:26.110",
    "start_seconds": 143.474,
    "end_seconds": 146.11,
    "text": "than from burning coal and gas and oil."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:26.143",
    "end": "00:02:27.611",
    "start_seconds": 146.143,
    "end_seconds": 147.611,
    "text": "Let me repeat,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:27.645",
    "end": "00:02:31.715",
    "start_seconds": 147.645,
    "end_seconds": 151.715,
    "text": "we live on a planet where the cheapest way to make power"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:31.715",
    "end": "00:02:35.219",
    "start_seconds": 151.715,
    "end_seconds": 155.219,
    "text": "is to point a sheet of glass at the sun."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:35.252",
    "end": "00:02:39.456",
    "start_seconds": 155.252,
    "end_seconds": 159.45600000000002,
    "text": "(Applause)"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:39.456",
    "end": "00:02:44.395",
    "start_seconds": 159.45600000000002,
    "end_seconds": 164.395,
    "text": "If we can keep the staggering growth of the last 36 months going,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:44.428",
    "end": "00:02:47.064",
    "start_seconds": 164.428,
    "end_seconds": 167.064,
    "text": "then we could enter an extraordinary new age."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:47.097",
    "end": "00:02:48.532",
    "start_seconds": 167.097,
    "end_seconds": 168.53199999999998,
    "text": "Consider."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:48.566",
    "end": "00:02:51.068",
    "start_seconds": 168.566,
    "end_seconds": 171.06799999999998,
    "text": "Eight or nine million people a year die"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:51.101",
    "end": "00:02:54.271",
    "start_seconds": 171.101,
    "end_seconds": 174.27100000000002,
    "text": "from breathing the combustion byproducts of fossil fuels."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:54.271",
    "end": "00:02:57.074",
    "start_seconds": 174.27100000000002,
    "end_seconds": 177.074,
    "text": "That's one death in five on this planet."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:57.541",
    "end": "00:02:59.210",
    "start_seconds": 177.541,
    "end_seconds": 179.21,
    "text": "But the Chinese cities,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:59.243",
    "end": "00:03:04.014",
    "start_seconds": 179.243,
    "end_seconds": 184.014,
    "text": "whose air was so foul a few years ago that you couldn't see across the street,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:04.048",
    "end": "00:03:05.883",
    "start_seconds": 184.048,
    "end_seconds": 185.883,
    "text": "are suddenly much cleaner."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:05.916",
    "end": "00:03:09.186",
    "start_seconds": 185.916,
    "end_seconds": 189.186,
    "text": "Most of the cars sold there now come with a plug,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:09.186",
    "end": "00:03:12.756",
    "start_seconds": 189.186,
    "end_seconds": 192.756,
    "text": "and it connects them to the vast solar and wind farms"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:12.790",
    "end": "00:03:16.393",
    "start_seconds": 192.79,
    "end_seconds": 196.393,
    "text": "that the Chinese are building faster than anyone on Earth."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:16.427",
    "end": "00:03:17.962",
    "start_seconds": 196.427,
    "end_seconds": 197.962,
    "text": "More fundamentally,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:17.995",
    "end": "00:03:21.632",
    "start_seconds": 197.995,
    "end_seconds": 201.632,
    "text": "this energy transition is our only real chance"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:21.632",
    "end": "00:03:25.703",
    "start_seconds": 201.632,
    "end_seconds": 205.703,
    "text": "of even starting to catch up with the physics of climate change."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:25.736",
    "end": "00:03:29.039",
    "start_seconds": 205.736,
    "end_seconds": 209.039,
    "text": "It's too late to stop global warming."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:29.073",
    "end": "00:03:30.641",
    "start_seconds": 209.073,
    "end_seconds": 210.641,
    "text": "But it's not too late"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:30.674",
    "end": "00:03:35.212",
    "start_seconds": 210.674,
    "end_seconds": 215.212,
    "text": "to shave tenths of a degree off how hot the planet [will] eventually get."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:35.246",
    "end": "00:03:37.348",
    "start_seconds": 215.246,
    "end_seconds": 217.348,
    "text": "And each 10th of a degree that we raise"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:37.381",
    "end": "00:03:41.352",
    "start_seconds": 217.381,
    "end_seconds": 221.352,
    "text": "the temperature moves 100 million of our brothers and sisters"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:41.385",
    "end": "00:03:45.623",
    "start_seconds": 221.385,
    "end_seconds": 225.623,
    "text": "out of a safe climate zone and into a more perilous one."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:46.390",
    "end": "00:03:49.760",
    "start_seconds": 226.39,
    "end_seconds": 229.76,
    "text": "This new age would come with one other great bonus."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:49.793",
    "end": "00:03:53.731",
    "start_seconds": 229.793,
    "end_seconds": 233.731,
    "text": "Unlike fossil fuels, which are concentrated in a few places,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:53.764",
    "end": "00:03:56.500",
    "start_seconds": 233.764,
    "end_seconds": 236.5,
    "text": "the sun's energy is available everywhere."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:56.867",
    "end": "00:04:01.305",
    "start_seconds": 236.867,
    "end_seconds": 241.305,
    "text": "Instead of, say, attacking Venezuela to secure its oil"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:01.338",
    "end": "00:04:04.308",
    "start_seconds": 241.338,
    "end_seconds": 244.308,
    "text": "or threatening to cut off Europe's gas supply"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:04.341",
    "end": "00:04:06.910",
    "start_seconds": 244.341,
    "end_seconds": 246.91,
    "text": "to force the subjugation of Ukraine,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:06.944",
    "end": "00:04:08.612",
    "start_seconds": 246.944,
    "end_seconds": 248.612,
    "text": "we get to imagine a world"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:08.646",
    "end": "00:04:12.416",
    "start_seconds": 248.64600000000002,
    "end_seconds": 252.416,
    "text": "where hydrocarbons no longer equal wealth and power."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:12.449",
    "end": "00:04:15.686",
    "start_seconds": 252.449,
    "end_seconds": 255.686,
    "text": "Imagine how many fewer wars and coups"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:15.719",
    "end": "00:04:19.123",
    "start_seconds": 255.719,
    "end_seconds": 259.123,
    "text": "and terrorist plots we would have seen in the last century"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:19.156",
    "end": "00:04:21.759",
    "start_seconds": 259.156,
    "end_seconds": 261.759,
    "text": "if oil had been of trivial value."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:22.293",
    "end": "00:04:27.498",
    "start_seconds": 262.293,
    "end_seconds": 267.498,
    "text": "As this spring has reminded us, humans are all too good at starting wars."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:27.498",
    "end": "00:04:28.766",
    "start_seconds": 267.498,
    "end_seconds": 268.766,
    "text": "But even for us,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:28.799",
    "end": "00:04:33.103",
    "start_seconds": 268.799,
    "end_seconds": 273.103,
    "text": "figuring out how to fight one over sunshine will be tricky."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:33.137",
    "end": "00:04:38.509",
    "start_seconds": 273.137,
    "end_seconds": 278.509,
    "text": "Sunlight travels 93 million miles to reach the Earth,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:38.542",
    "end": "00:04:41.879",
    "start_seconds": 278.54200000000003,
    "end_seconds": 281.879,
    "text": "but none of those miles go through the Strait of Hormuz."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:42.212",
    "end": "00:04:48.652",
    "start_seconds": 282.212,
    "end_seconds": 288.652,
    "text": "(Applause)"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:48.686",
    "end": "00:04:50.387",
    "start_seconds": 288.686,
    "end_seconds": 290.387,
    "text": "So what’s good news?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:50.921",
    "end": "00:04:54.758",
    "start_seconds": 290.921,
    "end_seconds": 294.758,
    "text": "Unless, of course, you own an oil well or a coal mine."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:55.292",
    "end": "00:04:59.096",
    "start_seconds": 295.29200000000003,
    "end_seconds": 299.096,
    "text": "Then the rise of clean energy becomes an extraordinary threat,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:59.129",
    "end": "00:05:01.665",
    "start_seconds": 299.129,
    "end_seconds": 301.665,
    "text": "one that mobilizes you to fight back."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:01.699",
    "end": "00:05:03.400",
    "start_seconds": 301.699,
    "end_seconds": 303.4,
    "text": "In the US, for instance,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:03.434",
    "end": "00:05:07.604",
    "start_seconds": 303.434,
    "end_seconds": 307.604,
    "text": "candidate Trump told the oil industry that if they donated huge sums,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:07.638",
    "end": "00:05:09.206",
    "start_seconds": 307.638,
    "end_seconds": 309.206,
    "text": "he would have their back."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:09.239",
    "end": "00:05:10.774",
    "start_seconds": 309.239,
    "end_seconds": 310.774,
    "text": "In his first year in office,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:10.808",
    "end": "00:05:14.445",
    "start_seconds": 310.808,
    "end_seconds": 314.445,
    "text": "he shut down huge wind farms off the eastern seaboard [and]"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:14.445",
    "end": "00:05:16.880",
    "start_seconds": 314.445,
    "end_seconds": 316.88,
    "text": "killed solar farms across the country."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:17.348",
    "end": "00:05:22.653",
    "start_seconds": 317.348,
    "end_seconds": 322.653,
    "text": "Now Trump can’t stop clean energy single-handedly."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:22.686",
    "end": "00:05:25.155",
    "start_seconds": 322.686,
    "end_seconds": 325.155,
    "text": "It's not like he's Jesus or something."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:25.189",
    "end": "00:05:27.358",
    "start_seconds": 325.189,
    "end_seconds": 327.358,
    "text": "(Laughter)"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:27.391",
    "end": "00:05:30.728",
    "start_seconds": 327.391,
    "end_seconds": 330.728,
    "text": "(Applause and cheers)"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:30.728",
    "end": "00:05:34.598",
    "start_seconds": 330.728,
    "end_seconds": 334.598,
    "text": "Indeed, the economics are so favorable that even in the US,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:34.631",
    "end": "00:05:38.602",
    "start_seconds": 334.631,
    "end_seconds": 338.602,
    "text": "most new electric generation last year came from the sun and the wind."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:38.635",
    "end": "00:05:42.606",
    "start_seconds": 338.635,
    "end_seconds": 342.606,
    "text": "And the biggest growth was in the state of Texas,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:42.639",
    "end": "00:05:44.808",
    "start_seconds": 342.639,
    "end_seconds": 344.808,
    "text": "the home ground of big oil."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:45.242",
    "end": "00:05:47.945",
    "start_seconds": 345.242,
    "end_seconds": 347.945,
    "text": "But Trump and Russia and Saudi Arabia"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:47.945",
    "end": "00:05:52.616",
    "start_seconds": 347.945,
    "end_seconds": 352.616,
    "text": "and a handful of other world powers may be able to slow that shift."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:52.983",
    "end": "00:05:56.887",
    "start_seconds": 352.983,
    "end_seconds": 356.887,
    "text": "America's Secretary of Energy, against all global evidence,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:56.920",
    "end": "00:05:59.356",
    "start_seconds": 356.92,
    "end_seconds": 359.356,
    "text": "has said there's no climate crisis,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:59.356",
    "end": "00:06:02.793",
    "start_seconds": 359.356,
    "end_seconds": 362.793,
    "text": "and we're not in the middle of an energy transition, either."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:02.793",
    "end": "00:06:05.529",
    "start_seconds": 362.793,
    "end_seconds": 365.529,
    "text": "So he's been subsidizing coal"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:05.562",
    "end": "00:06:09.233",
    "start_seconds": 365.562,
    "end_seconds": 369.233,
    "text": "instead of embracing the clean energy that would, say,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:09.266",
    "end": "00:06:14.104",
    "start_seconds": 369.266,
    "end_seconds": 374.104,
    "text": "let us build any data centers we actually needed quickly and cheaply."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:14.138",
    "end": "00:06:16.673",
    "start_seconds": 374.138,
    "end_seconds": 376.673,
    "text": "As the Chinese have amply demonstrated,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:16.707",
    "end": "00:06:20.144",
    "start_seconds": 376.707,
    "end_seconds": 380.144,
    "text": "solar fields can sprout in a matter of weeks."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:21.011",
    "end": "00:06:26.283",
    "start_seconds": 381.011,
    "end_seconds": 386.283,
    "text": "America’s effort to delay this transition is not just economically stupid --"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:26.316",
    "end": "00:06:30.387",
    "start_seconds": 386.316,
    "end_seconds": 390.387,
    "text": "it also endangers the last, best hope of cooling this Earth."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:30.421",
    "end": "00:06:31.955",
    "start_seconds": 390.421,
    "end_seconds": 391.955,
    "text": "Sure, in 40 years,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:31.989",
    "end": "00:06:34.958",
    "start_seconds": 391.989,
    "end_seconds": 394.95799999999997,
    "text": "we will run the planet on sun and wind because it's cheap."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:34.992",
    "end": "00:06:38.228",
    "start_seconds": 394.992,
    "end_seconds": 398.228,
    "text": "But if it takes us anything like 40 years to get there,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:38.228",
    "end": "00:06:41.899",
    "start_seconds": 398.228,
    "end_seconds": 401.899,
    "text": "then the planet we run on sun and wind will be a broken planet."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:42.499",
    "end": "00:06:45.135",
    "start_seconds": 402.499,
    "end_seconds": 405.135,
    "text": "So those of us who hope for a different future"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:45.169",
    "end": "00:06:46.670",
    "start_seconds": 405.169,
    "end_seconds": 406.67,
    "text": "need to fight for it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:46.703",
    "end": "00:06:48.338",
    "start_seconds": 406.703,
    "end_seconds": 408.338,
    "text": "And with the cheap solar panel,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:48.372",
    "end": "00:06:51.642",
    "start_seconds": 408.372,
    "end_seconds": 411.642,
    "text": "we finally have a real weapon in that struggle."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:51.675",
    "end": "00:06:53.410",
    "start_seconds": 411.675,
    "end_seconds": 413.40999999999997,
    "text": "We need to push in every country"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:53.444",
    "end": "00:06:55.145",
    "start_seconds": 413.444,
    "end_seconds": 415.145,
    "text": "and at every level of government"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:55.179",
    "end": "00:06:58.682",
    "start_seconds": 415.179,
    "end_seconds": 418.682,
    "text": "for a faster move toward cheap, clean power."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:59.116",
    "end": "00:07:02.753",
    "start_seconds": 419.116,
    "end_seconds": 422.753,
    "text": "We started Sun Day in the US last year"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:02.753",
    "end": "00:07:05.489",
    "start_seconds": 422.753,
    "end_seconds": 425.489,
    "text": "on the autumnal equinox across the nation,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:05.489",
    "end": "00:07:08.725",
    "start_seconds": 425.489,
    "end_seconds": 428.725,
    "text": "500 events -- from solar-powered concerts"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:08.759",
    "end": "00:07:12.896",
    "start_seconds": 428.759,
    "end_seconds": 432.896,
    "text": "to the installation of solar panels on Habitat for Humanity homes"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:12.930",
    "end": "00:07:15.566",
    "start_seconds": 432.93,
    "end_seconds": 435.566,
    "text": "helped spread this new energy gospel."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:15.599",
    "end": "00:07:20.237",
    "start_seconds": 435.599,
    "end_seconds": 440.237,
    "text": "We'll do it again on the summer solstice in 2027,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:20.270",
    "end": "00:07:23.073",
    "start_seconds": 440.27,
    "end_seconds": 443.073,
    "text": "and this time we will do it globally."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:23.740",
    "end": "00:07:28.078",
    "start_seconds": 443.74,
    "end_seconds": 448.078,
    "text": "Days like this help us build the political power we need"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:28.111",
    "end": "00:07:30.380",
    "start_seconds": 448.111,
    "end_seconds": 450.38,
    "text": "to push these things ahead."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:30.914",
    "end": "00:07:32.516",
    "start_seconds": 450.914,
    "end_seconds": 452.516,
    "text": "Americans, for instance,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:32.549",
    "end": "00:07:38.322",
    "start_seconds": 452.549,
    "end_seconds": 458.322,
    "text": "right now, pay three times what Europeans or Australians pay for solar power,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:38.355",
    "end": "00:07:43.093",
    "start_seconds": 458.355,
    "end_seconds": 463.093,
    "text": "mostly because of unnecessary bureaucracy at the state and local level."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:43.126",
    "end": "00:07:48.765",
    "start_seconds": 463.126,
    "end_seconds": 468.765,
    "text": "So Free the Rooftop is a cry that appeals to conservatives as much as liberals."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:48.799",
    "end": "00:07:51.869",
    "start_seconds": 468.799,
    "end_seconds": 471.869,
    "text": "Utah became the first American state last year"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:51.869",
    "end": "00:07:55.205",
    "start_seconds": 471.869,
    "end_seconds": 475.205,
    "text": "to legalize small-scale plug-in solar,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:55.239",
    "end": "00:07:58.041",
    "start_seconds": 475.239,
    "end_seconds": 478.041,
    "text": "opening the door for the kind of simple installations"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:58.075",
    "end": "00:08:01.812",
    "start_seconds": 478.075,
    "end_seconds": 481.812,
    "text": "that have sprouted on the balconies of millions of European apartments"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:01.812",
    "end": "00:08:03.480",
    "start_seconds": 481.812,
    "end_seconds": 483.48,
    "text": "in the last three years."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:03.514",
    "end": "00:08:06.450",
    "start_seconds": 483.514,
    "end_seconds": 486.45,
    "text": "Maine and Virginia joined Utah last week."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:07.217",
    "end": "00:08:09.887",
    "start_seconds": 487.217,
    "end_seconds": 489.887,
    "text": "So yeah, as we push ahead with this work,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:09.887",
    "end": "00:08:12.923",
    "start_seconds": 489.887,
    "end_seconds": 492.923,
    "text": "we need to talk about its scientific necessity"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:12.956",
    "end": "00:08:15.025",
    "start_seconds": 492.956,
    "end_seconds": 495.025,
    "text": "and its economic pragmatism."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:15.058",
    "end": "00:08:18.128",
    "start_seconds": 495.058,
    "end_seconds": 498.128,
    "text": "But we have one other ace to play,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:18.161",
    "end": "00:08:21.865",
    "start_seconds": 498.161,
    "end_seconds": 501.865,
    "text": "and that's the sheer beauty of power from the sun."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:21.899",
    "end": "00:08:25.402",
    "start_seconds": 501.899,
    "end_seconds": 505.402,
    "text": "We have a deep human connection to our local star."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:25.736",
    "end": "00:08:30.374",
    "start_seconds": 505.736,
    "end_seconds": 510.374,
    "text": "We don't know for sure how prehistoric people thought about things"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:30.374",
    "end": "00:08:34.011",
    "start_seconds": 510.374,
    "end_seconds": 514.011,
    "text": "because, being prehistoric, they failed to write it down."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:34.044",
    "end": "00:08:37.714",
    "start_seconds": 514.044,
    "end_seconds": 517.7139999999999,
    "text": "But we do know that every pile of rocks they left behind,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:37.748",
    "end": "00:08:42.152",
    "start_seconds": 517.748,
    "end_seconds": 522.152,
    "text": "like Stonehenge, seems to point to the equinox or the solstice."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:43.053",
    "end": "00:08:46.290",
    "start_seconds": 523.053,
    "end_seconds": 526.29,
    "text": "Do you not break into an involuntary grin"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:46.323",
    "end": "00:08:50.861",
    "start_seconds": 526.323,
    "end_seconds": 530.861,
    "text": "when the sun comes out from behind a cloud and hits you on the shoulder blades?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:50.894",
    "end": "00:08:52.763",
    "start_seconds": 530.894,
    "end_seconds": 532.763,
    "text": "If you don't get enough sun,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:52.796",
    "end": "00:08:58.235",
    "start_seconds": 532.796,
    "end_seconds": 538.235,
    "text": "you literally can get SAD -- seasonal affective disorder."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:58.669",
    "end": "00:09:02.139",
    "start_seconds": 538.669,
    "end_seconds": 542.139,
    "text": "So the mantra for this moment is clear:"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:02.172",
    "end": "00:09:05.242",
    "start_seconds": 542.172,
    "end_seconds": 545.242,
    "text": "energy from heaven, not from hell."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:05.909",
    "end": "00:09:12.516",
    "start_seconds": 545.909,
    "end_seconds": 552.516,
    "text": "(Cheers and applause)"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:12.549",
    "end": "00:09:16.620",
    "start_seconds": 552.549,
    "end_seconds": 556.62,
    "text": "And with that slogan, what a breakthrough moment this could be."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:16.653",
    "end": "00:09:21.058",
    "start_seconds": 556.653,
    "end_seconds": 561.058,
    "text": "I mean, humans have been burning things since the dawn of time."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:21.091",
    "end": "00:09:22.893",
    "start_seconds": 561.091,
    "end_seconds": 562.893,
    "text": "Darwin said language and fire"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:22.926",
    "end": "00:09:25.829",
    "start_seconds": 562.926,
    "end_seconds": 565.829,
    "text": "were the two things that set our species apart."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:25.829",
    "end": "00:09:27.397",
    "start_seconds": 565.829,
    "end_seconds": 567.397,
    "text": "And fire was mostly good."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:27.431",
    "end": "00:09:29.900",
    "start_seconds": 567.431,
    "end_seconds": 569.9,
    "text": "We learned to cook, which gave us the big brain."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:29.900",
    "end": "00:09:32.669",
    "start_seconds": 569.9,
    "end_seconds": 572.669,
    "text": "We could move north and south from the equator."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:32.703",
    "end": "00:09:34.304",
    "start_seconds": 572.703,
    "end_seconds": 574.304,
    "text": "Anthropologists even think"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:34.338",
    "end": "00:09:37.774",
    "start_seconds": 574.338,
    "end_seconds": 577.774,
    "text": "that eons of standing around the campfire every night"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:37.808",
    "end": "00:09:40.077",
    "start_seconds": 577.808,
    "end_seconds": 580.077,
    "text": "helped explain some of the social bonds"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:40.110",
    "end": "00:09:41.511",
    "start_seconds": 580.11,
    "end_seconds": 581.511,
    "text": "that mark our species."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:41.545",
    "end": "00:09:44.514",
    "start_seconds": 581.545,
    "end_seconds": 584.514,
    "text": "Think of it as a sort of primitive TED talk."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:44.548",
    "end": "00:09:45.549",
    "start_seconds": 584.548,
    "end_seconds": 585.549,
    "text": "(Laughter)"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:45.549",
    "end": "00:09:50.153",
    "start_seconds": 585.549,
    "end_seconds": 590.153,
    "text": "When we learned to control the combustion of coal and oil and gas,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:50.187",
    "end": "00:09:53.824",
    "start_seconds": 590.187,
    "end_seconds": 593.824,
    "text": "that was the Industrial Revolution, and it gave us modernity."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:54.424",
    "end": "00:09:59.763",
    "start_seconds": 594.424,
    "end_seconds": 599.763,
    "text": "But now the cost of those fires has simply grown too high."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:59.763",
    "end": "00:10:03.166",
    "start_seconds": 599.763,
    "end_seconds": 603.166,
    "text": "The very future of the climate on which we depend"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:03.200",
    "end": "00:10:06.003",
    "start_seconds": 603.2,
    "end_seconds": 606.003,
    "text": "is being overwhelmed by their smoke."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:06.036",
    "end": "00:10:09.606",
    "start_seconds": 606.036,
    "end_seconds": 609.606,
    "text": "So what sweet relief that in this exact moment,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:09.640",
    "end": "00:10:11.308",
    "start_seconds": 609.64,
    "end_seconds": 611.308,
    "text": "we can, if we want,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:11.308",
    "end": "00:10:13.076",
    "start_seconds": 611.308,
    "end_seconds": 613.076,
    "text": "put out those fires,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:13.110",
    "end": "00:10:14.945",
    "start_seconds": 613.11,
    "end_seconds": 614.945,
    "text": "the big ones in our power plants,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:14.978",
    "end": "00:10:19.416",
    "start_seconds": 614.978,
    "end_seconds": 619.416,
    "text": "the smaller ones in our furnaces and under the hoods of our cars."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:19.449",
    "end": "00:10:23.720",
    "start_seconds": 619.449,
    "end_seconds": 623.72,
    "text": "The sun already gives us light and warmth"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:23.754",
    "end": "00:10:26.456",
    "start_seconds": 623.754,
    "end_seconds": 626.456,
    "text": "and, via photosynthesis, our supper."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:26.490",
    "end": "00:10:31.061",
    "start_seconds": 626.49,
    "end_seconds": 631.061,
    "text": "Now it is willing to provide us with all the power we could ever need."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:31.061",
    "end": "00:10:35.399",
    "start_seconds": 631.061,
    "end_seconds": 635.399,
    "text": "This gift has come at the last possible moment."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:35.432",
    "end": "00:10:38.902",
    "start_seconds": 635.432,
    "end_seconds": 638.902,
    "text": "It would be an extraordinary sin to waste it,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:38.902",
    "end": "00:10:42.706",
    "start_seconds": 638.902,
    "end_seconds": 642.706,
    "text": "and it would be a beautiful, beautiful project"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:42.739",
    "end": "00:10:45.142",
    "start_seconds": 642.739,
    "end_seconds": 645.142,
    "text": "for humans to build it out"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:45.175",
    "end": "00:10:50.313",
    "start_seconds": 645.175,
    "end_seconds": 650.313,
    "text": "across our hot and tired Earth in the next few years."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:50.614",
    "end": "00:10:54.751",
    "start_seconds": 650.614,
    "end_seconds": 654.751,
    "text": "In advance of your participation in that fight,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:54.751",
    "end": "00:10:56.787",
    "start_seconds": 654.751,
    "end_seconds": 656.787,
    "text": "let me just say, thank you."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:57.354",
    "end": "00:11:03.727",
    "start_seconds": 657.354,
    "end_seconds": 663.727,
    "text": "(Cheers and applause)"
  }
]
